  "body": " Hyperkähler rotation  Let be a compact connected special Lagrangian submanifold. The following conditions are equivalent:  The underlying submanifold is -holomorphic Lagrangian.  The restricted class vanishes in .  With the calibration orientation,   If is -holomorphic Lagrangian, then , giving (ii). If (ii) holds, every term containing a factor in the expansion of the left side of (iii) integrates to zero: the other factors are closed, and the restriction of is exact. Thus (ii) implies (iii).  Suppose (iii) holds. Calibration gives Equality in the Wirtinger inequality implies that every tangent space of is -invariant. Thus is an -complex submanifold. Since was Lagrangian for , and the form also vanishes on its tangent bundle. Hence , proving (i).  "
